WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:01.497
Warning! Warning!

2
00:00:01.497 --> 00:00:06.705
I built this with AI and text to speech, because I can't narrate for shit!

3
00:00:08.100 --> 00:00:09.392
Hey, Dreamer here.

4
00:00:09.392 --> 00:00:15.565
Today, the numbers behind every character: attributes, and what each one does for you.

5
00:00:16.967 --> 00:00:19.116
Open Mechanics, then Attributes.

6
00:00:19.116 --> 00:00:25.631
Voyage starts you with six: strength, dexterity, constitution, intelligence, wisdom and charisma.

7
00:00:25.631 --> 00:00:32.280
You can rename them or add your own, and the AI reads the names to decide which one an action uses.

8
00:00:32.733 --> 00:00:36.968
Starting attribute value is where every attribute begins, eight here,

9
00:00:36.968 --> 00:00:40.588
and max starting attribute caps them at character creation.

10
00:00:41.033 --> 00:00:46.974
The bonus modifier turns an attribute into a bonus on rolls: take ten off the score and multiply.

11
00:00:46.974 --> 00:00:50.159
At two and a half, a sixteen gives you plus fifteen.

12
00:00:50.600 --> 00:00:54.040
Stat modifiers let an attribute raise a resource.

13
00:00:54.040 --> 00:00:57.550
Every point of constitution gives two more health.

14
00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:02.916
Damage modifiers add damage per point, two percent per point of strength for us.

15
00:01:02.916 --> 00:01:07.218
Damage reduction takes damage off, one percent per point of dexterity.

16
00:01:07.667 --> 00:01:09.383
And low attribute traits.

17
00:01:09.383 --> 00:01:13.845
Drop to the threshold or below and the character gets a weakness,

18
00:01:13.845 --> 00:01:17.071
like Low Strength, described in your own words.

19
00:01:18.467 --> 00:01:20.350
One thing that confuses everyone.

20
00:01:20.350 --> 00:01:25.487
Characters get their attributes from traits, the picks they make in the character creator.

21
00:01:25.487 --> 00:01:30.853
The starting attribute points box is an old leftover that does nothing in a world with traits.

22
00:01:30.853 --> 00:01:32.793
We build traits later this season.

23
00:01:34.200 --> 00:01:35.492
That's attributes.

24
00:01:35.492 --> 00:01:38.005
Ours are linked in the description.

25
00:01:38.005 --> 00:01:42.385
Next time, abilities: the moves your characters can pull off.

26
00:01:42.833 --> 00:01:46.781
I'm Dreamer. Now go build something weird, and I'll see you next time!

